{"name":"Thorngarten Monk","size":"medium","type":"Humanoid","tag":"Elf","alignment":"lawful good","hitDice":"5","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":2,"otherArmorDesc":"13 (leather armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"36 (8d8)","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"9","dexPoints":"16","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"16","chaPoints":"14","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"3","customCr":"2 (450 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The cult fanatic can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The cult fanatic regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the cult fanatic can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the cult fanatic can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The cult fanatic can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the cult fanatic's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the cult fanatic's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the cult fanatic dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Adhael's Blood Plague","desc":"[MON]'s form is unstable and only partially on this plane. [MON] has disadvantage on saving throws against conjuration spells and vulnerability to force damage.\n\nHowever, [MON] can also cast _Etherealness_ once per day, and has advantage on charisma checks when interacting with spiritual creatures."},{"name":"Plaguebearer","desc":"Upon death, [MON] returns as a **Risen Monk** at the start of it's next turn, unless the disease is removed with a _remove curse, greater restoration,_ or _wish_ spell."},{"name":"Elven Wiles","desc":"[MON] has advantage on saving throws against being charmed or frightened and cannot be put to sleep by magical means."},{"name":"Spellcasting","desc":"The fanatic is a 4th-level spellcaster. Its spell casting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC [WIS SAVE], [WIS ATK] to hit with spell attacks). The fanatic has the following cleric spells prepared:\n\n\n> Cantrips (at will): _mind sliver, thaumaturgy_\n>\n> 1/day (each): _hold person, frost fingers ([2d8] 15 ft. cone), sanctuary (bonus action)_"}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The fanatic makes two dagger attacks."},{"name":"Dagger","desc":"_Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack:_ +4 to hit, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft., one creature. _Hit:_ 4 (1d4 + 2) piercing damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[{"name":"deception","stat":"cha"},{"name":"persuasion","stat":"cha"},{"name":"religion","stat":"int"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Aire","speaks":true},{"name":"Elvish","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}